  dialogueLine:
  - Hello! I have happened to lose my wedding ring on the southwest side of the town.
  - Would you mind getting it for me? I will pay good.
  - Excellent. I will be waiting.
  - Ah, that's a shame. I am still expecting you to help though.
  - Still waiting on the ring.
  - My gratitude to thee!
  - I believe Ken also lost his skateboard, if you don't mind helping him as well.
